    {
      "name": "merge-incidents",
      "description": "Merge one source incident into an open target incident: the target takes the source's alerts and the source is resolved. Only incidents with alerts, or opened by hand, can be merged, and the target must be open. Read back from the source incident; it must be resolved with the target as its merge reason. Cannot be undone.",
